# CH12 rescue: pick five of eight, the hidden timer at the lift, the Bound (story/rescue.gd).
@scene CH12_HINT1
shake 0.4
say narr | The cable groans on the drum and settles. It is holding. For now.
@end

@scene CH12_HINT2
shake 0.4
say ilyr | (Through Raven's throat:) Five hearts, below. Still climbing. Wait.
@end

@scene CH12_HINT3
shake 0.4
say survivor | The brake! Pull it, or we all go down with them!
say dain | Not yet.
@end

@scene CH12_HINT4
shake 0.4
say narr | A rivet shears from the housing and rings all the way down the shaft.
@end

@scene CH12_HINT5
shake 0.4
say oriel | There is still someone down there. I can feel them climbing.
@end

@scene CH12_HINT6
shake 0.4
say narr | The cable begins to unravel, one strand at a time.
say dain | Wait. Wait for them.
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C02
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C02
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say tessa | Four tenders. They're light, they're starving, and one of them bit me. Take them.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Morwen is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C03
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C03
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say corren | Cells are empty. I took the long way back. I always do.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Vespera is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C04
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C04
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say ivo | Unchained eleven. Carried two. Recommend we leave now.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Golem is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C05
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C05
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say nera | Every road out of there is gone except the one we made. Go.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Elowen is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C07
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C07
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say sable | Tenders out. No one left in the cells. That's the count.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Oni is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C08
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C08
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say pip | Got them! All of them! Even the grumpy one. Especially the grumpy one.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Sak is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C09
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C09
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say kitsune | An illusion held the door while the real ones ran. The prisoners are out. Mostly real.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Kitsune is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_ARRIVE_C10
sfx FX028
show resc 12 6 right C10
move resc right right right right right right right right right
hide resc
say archangel | Order kept. Every prisoner accounted for. Board.
if var:rescue_left==0 last
say narr | (Archangel is on the cage. {v:rescue_left} still below.)
end
label last
call CH12_LAST_SECOND
@end

@scene CH12_LAST_SECOND
shake 1.0
say narr | The last of them leaps the gap as the housing splits. Every one of the five is on the cage.
say dain | Now!
call CH12_LIFT_DROP
@end

@scene CH12_LIFT_LEVER
say narr | The cable brake. One pull and the cage drops.
choice | Pull the brake -> pull | Wait -> wait
label wait
say dain | Not yet.
end
label pull
if var:rescue_left>0 warn
call CH12_LIFT_DROP
end
label warn
say oriel | {v:rescue_left} of them are still down there.
choice | Pull it anyway -> go | Wait -> wait2
label wait2
say dain | We wait.
end
label go
call CH12_LIFT_DROP
@end

@scene CH12_LIFT_AUREX
say oriel | I can hold the channel shut a little longer. The cable is another matter.
say oriel | Whatever you decide, decide it with them in mind. Not with the cable.
@end

@scene CH12_LIFT_TENDER
say survivor | They came back for us. Nobody comes back for relay tenders.
@end

@scene CH12_LIFT_CRUSH
shake 1.2
sfx FX015
flash #ffffff
say narr | The cable lets go. The cage falls into the Conduit with everyone in it.
rescue crush
@end

@scene CH12_LIFT_DROP
sfx FX015
say narr | Raven hauls the brake. The cage drops.
rescue finish
if flag:rescue_all all
say narr | Behind them, the cells vanish under the flood, and whoever was still below goes with them.
say oriel | ...They were so close.
say dain | Remember their names. We are not done with them.
goto fall
label all
say narr | Five rescuers, every tender, and the cage still on its cable. For one heartbeat, nobody breathes.
say dain | Everyone. You brought everyone.
label fall
call CH12_FALL_BODY
@end

@scene BOUND_INTRO
say narr | ...
say narr | Elsewhere. Under the roots of the drowned Conduit, a green fire burns.
still ST09_rootwell
bound swap
if !changed:C02 skip_c02
say tessa | Something followed me up out of the dark. It's warm. It's in my chest, next to the light I borrowed.
label skip_c02
if !changed:C03 skip_c03
say corren | I remember the water closing. Then a voice that wasn't a god's, asking whether I'd finished.
label skip_c03
if !changed:C04 skip_c04
say ivo | Unit crushed. Unit reassembled. The hands that rebuilt me were not mine and not yours.
label skip_c04
if !changed:C05 skip_c05
say nera | The roots found me in the dark, and something older than the roots found them.
label skip_c05
if !changed:C07 skip_c07
say sable | I held the door. The door held me. Something on the other side let me walk back through it.
label skip_c07
if !changed:C08 skip_c08
say pip | Something clicked me back together. I have a new tail. It's brass. It's great. Don't look at it.
label skip_c08
if !changed:C09 skip_c09
say kitsune | I lied to death. Death didn't care. A dragon's ember did, and it stayed.
label skip_c09
if !changed:C10 skip_c10
say archangel | My host stopped answering long ago. When I fell, something else did.
label skip_c10
say narr | The ones who died came back changed. The ones who carried them out cannot walk away from them. The bond pulls like a rope around the heart.
say narr | (The Bound are a party of their own, and their formation is fixed. Switch between them and Raven's company from the menu, at a save point or on the world map.)
say narr | (The bond will loosen once one of the ancient dragons has fallen.)
objective narr | The Bound: climb out of the Rootwell and find a way through the ruined world.
bound swap
@end

@scene BOUND_SWAP
bound swap
@end

@scene BOUND_FIRE
say narr | The green fire burns without smoke. Sitting close to it, the five hear each other's hearts.
heal
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C02
if !changed:C02 survivor
say tessa | I died, Raven. Down there. A dragon fragment lit in me like a lamp in an empty house. I can't go far from the others - the ones who carried me out. Not yet.
end
label survivor
say tessa | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C03
if !changed:C03 survivor
say corren | I drowned in the cells, Raven. Mother Sepulchre's court sent me back because I hadn't finished running. The ones who pulled me out - I'm tied to them now.
end
label survivor
say corren | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C04
if !changed:C04 survivor
say ivo | I was broken under the relay. CURATOR's machines in the Deep rebuilt me - better, it says. I disagree. I stay with the four who carried my pieces.
end
label survivor
say ivo | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C05
if !changed:C05 survivor
say nera | I was buried, Raven. A dragon's splinter grew through me like a root through stone. The ones who dug me out are my grove now. I have to go back to them.
end
label survivor
say nera | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C07
if !changed:C07 survivor
say sable | I held the cell door until the channel came in. Mother Sepulchre's court sent me back with the door still in my hands. I owe the four who waited for me. I don't leave a debt behind.
end
label survivor
say sable | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C08
if !changed:C08 survivor
say pip | I got squashed, Raven. Properly. One of CURATOR's machines put me back together and forgot to ask what cats are for. The others remembered. I'm staying with them.
end
label survivor
say pip | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C09
if !changed:C09 survivor
say kitsune | I burned out in the cells, Raven. A dragon's ember took my illusions for a home. I rule nothing now except the four who carried my ashes out. That's enough court for me.
end
label survivor
say kitsune | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

@scene BOUND_MEET_C10
if !changed:C10 survivor
say archangel | I fell in the cells, Raven, and Mother Sepulchre's court raised me instead of the sky. I serve the four who waited for me. That is the only order I have left.
end
label survivor
say archangel | I made it out, Raven. The ones who didn't came back, and I owe them my life. I go where they go - for now.
@end

